<title>USA: Blue Chip Casino sets $86 mln in 144A notes. [CORRECTED 18:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Blue Chip Casino sets $86 mln in 144A notes. [CORRECTED 18:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Blue Chip Casino was priced on Thursday, according to sole manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette.</p>
<p>BORROWER BLUE CHIP CASINO</p>
<p>AMT $86 MLN		  COUPON 13.75 PCT  MATURITY 11/15/2003</p>
<p>TYPE 144A SNR SEC NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3	   YIELD 13.75	 PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS	   SPREAD N.A.	 CALLABLE AFTER FOUR</p>
<p>								YEARS</p>
<p>(Corrects last Moody's rating from Ba3 to B3)</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
